the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Identität geprüft of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    the Einkommen of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Schufa Score of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    Root holds for *a case*.
    Alternative holds for *a case*.
    Schnellprüfung holds for *a case*.
    Hauptprüfung holds for *a case*.
    Identitätsprüfung holds for *a case*.
    Bonitätsprüfung holds for *a case*.
    Einkommensprüfung holds for *a case*.
    Schufa Prüfung holds for *a case*.
    Einkommensprüfung would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Schufa Prüfung would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r6_5_nested_credit_checks includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/nested-credit-checks.ruml".

Root holds for a case if
    Hauptprüfung holds for the case
    and Alternative holds for the case
    and Schnellprüfung holds for the case.

Hauptprüfung holds for a case if
    Identitätsprüfung holds for the case
    and Bonitätsprüfung holds for the case.

Alternative holds for a case if
    Hauptprüfung holds for the case.

Schnellprüfung holds for a case if
    Bonitätsprüfung holds for the case.

Identitätsprüfung holds for a case if
    the Identität geprüft of the case is true.

Bonitätsprüfung holds for a case if
    Einkommensprüfung holds for the case
    and Schufa Prüfung holds for the case.

Einkommensprüfung holds for a case if
    the Einkommen of the case is a number N
    and N > 30000.

Einkommensprüfung holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Einkommen of the case is a number
    and Einkommensprüfung would hold for the case.

Schufa Prüfung holds for a case if
    the Schufa Score of the case is a number N
    and N >= 600.

Schufa Prüfung holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Schufa Score of the case is a number
    and Schufa Prüfung would hold for the case.

